# Bundled dub runtime lands here at build time (CI downloads per-OS):
#   Windows: node.exe, ffmpeg.exe, ffprobe.exe, uv.exe, uvx.exe
#   macOS:   (none — falls back to ~/.local; customer target is Windows)
# This .keep keeps the `binaries/*` tauri resource glob non-empty so local/mac
# builds never fail on an empty glob. The real binaries are gitignored.
